# SLICE-01b: DesertCtl `set` names an asset reference by its `assets:` path (UE soft object path), resolved through the
# content registry as the Details picker resolves a dropped file; a path of the wrong kind or one naming nothing is
# refused with the reason (--expect-refusal: the step passes only when the editor refuses; the reason lands in
# editor.log as "[Control] set ... refused"). The scenario does NOT save the scene.
Дано run Scene "Open Scene Starter.desce"
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
# the Campfire entity (VFX.System = Campfire.dfx) is lifted onto the Cylinder's top as a torch post
Дано run Entity "Add to selection Campfire"
Дано --subject selection set Translation 120,150,260
Когда set 1414213562373095048 VFX.System assets:VFX/Torch.dfx
Когда run Action Simulate
Когда advance 1
Когда advance 1
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 400,190,260
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction -1,0.1,0
Тогда-вид 0_torch the Torch: a narrow tall flame with a smoke column and embers on the post, not the wide campfire
Когда --expect-refusal set 1414213562373095048 VFX.System assets:Materials/CB_Glass.demat
Когда --expect-refusal set 1414213562373095048 VFX.System assets:VFX/NoSuchSystem.dfx
Когда advance 1
Тогда-вид 1_refused still the Torch after both refused sets (the wrong-type material and the missing path)
Когда run Action Stop
